 # Changelog — world/core
 
+## 0.1.2 — 2026-11-16
+
+**Compiler-compatibility fix: the kernel's contracts type-check under AILANG v0.60.4.** No exported
+signature changed.
+
+- `EvidenceGrade` and `TimeoutOutcome` derive `Eq`, so `gradeOf`'s and `timeoutOutcome`'s
+  `ensures` (which compare results with `==`) type-check now that contract clauses are typed.
+- `plan`'s and `verify`'s `ensures` compare digest references field by field (`algo`, `digest`),
+  the idiom `applyRevision` already used. The proven laws are unchanged.
+
+Contracts: **16 verified, 0 refuted**. Effects: still **none**.
+
